<Base title="About | Steel & Code" description="Steel & Code builds useful technology and shares practical lessons through applied work."><section class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT STEEL &amp; CODE</p><h1>Teach, refine,<br/><span>simplify.</span></h1><p class="lead">We build useful technology, explore ambitious ideas, and teach what we learn.</p></section><div class="prose"><h2>Craftsmen make craftsmen.</h2><p>Strong practitioners help others develop their skills by sharing their reasoning, working through mistakes, and making difficult ideas easier to understand.</p><p>Our approach is practical: define the problem, build a small solution, check the result, and improve it.</p><h2>Experience put to work.</h2><p>The founder’s background spans data analytics and business intelligence, Python and SQL, higher education instruction, and military analytical experience.</p><p>Steel &amp; Code brings those experiences together through engineering, creative projects, and learning by doing.</p><h2>Follow the work.</h2><p><a href="https://github.com/steel-and-code">Explore our projects on GitHub ↗</a></p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@CozySpaceBard">Visit Cozy Space Bard on YouTube ↗</a></p></div></Base>
